      this.setState({ registrations: updatedRegistrations }); // update the state with the new registrations array
    });
}
```

This approach creates a copy of the `registrations` array using the spread operator (`...this.state.registrations`), updates the desired registration object at the given index, and then sets the new state with the updated array. This ensures that the state is being correctly managed without any direct manipulation.
